%e A401467     |   |   |           |   |   |
%e A401467     37  17  5---7---7---7   26  50
%e A401467     |   |                   |   |
%e A401467     37  17--21--21--21--21--21  50
%e A401467     |                           |
%e A401467     37--43--43--43--43--43--43--42
%e A401467 .
%e A401467 .
%e A401467 a(9) = 7 as the pole at that position can see 7 of the previous 9 poles - it can not see the pole a(6) = 5 nor a(7) = 7. This is the first term to differ from A400185, where the pole a(7) = 7 can be seen.
